            "failure_scenario": "build() keeps absorbing sizing and fallback logic (KvLen match, fit check, eprintln); the next branch added to it crosses the cyclomatic threshold of 10 and lands in the hotspot list.",
            "precision_class": "advisory"
          }
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "tdg_mod_rs_decrease",
          "level": "note",
          "message": {
            "text": "pmat tdg grade for gguf/cuda/mod.rs stays A but its score fell from 94.76 (base) to 90.85 (head); duplication_ratio 17.75 is the largest component. The two new files grade A+ (session_kv.rs 96.82, resident.rs 98.64) and gpu_profile.rs is flat (86.87 to 86.82)."
          },
          "properties": {
            "grounding": "measured",
            "command": [
              "pmat",
              "tdg",
              "h1/mod.rs",
              "--format",
              "json"
            ],
            "exit_code": 0,
